### Health check
GET http://localhost:5010/health
Accept: application/json

### Get all medicines
GET http://localhost:5010/api/medicine
Accept: application/json

### Search medicine by name
GET http://localhost:5010/api/medicine/search?query=paracetamol
Accept: application/json

### Add medicine
POST http://localhost:5010/api/medicine
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ibuprofen 200mg",
  "notes": "Pain and inflammation relief",
  "expiryDate": "2029-12-31",
  "quantity": 50,
  "price": 18.99,
  "brand": "PharmaCare"
}

### Invalid medicine payload (validation example)
POST http://localhost:5003/api/medicine
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "notes": "Invalid medicine",
  "expiryDate": "2020-01-01",
  "quantity": -1,
  "price": 0,
  "brand": ""
}
